<title>UK: Murray Int. NAV increases in 1996.</title>
<headline>Murray Int. NAV increases in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		42.9		   vs 79.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.2		    vs 3.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 13.2		   vs 12.6</p>
<p> Revenue before tax     55.99		  vs 99..18</p>
<p> Revenue after tax	50.99		  vs 94.71</p>
<p> Net asset value	  510.9		  vs 475.6</p>
<p> Net asset value(pence) 425.1		  vs 395.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Murray International Trust forecast a dividend of 4.55p for 1997, making a total for the year of 14.0p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
